    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Lucan presents 12 Larkfield View to market. Located in this highly sought-after development, overlooking a large green area. This is a home which is sure to impress both families and first-time buyers alike. \nIf location, excellent condition and a south facing garden are on your wish list. Then look no further than number 12. \nThe property is in turnkey condition, having been lovingly maintained by the current owner. Internally the property is scheduled over three floors and boasts an excellent balance of both living and bedroom accommodation. \nAs one steps beyond the attractive red brick façade we are greeted by a welcoming entrance hall, which provides access to the kitchen/dining to the front. Ideal for entertaining, this space offers ample wall and floor storage units along with a bay window overlooking the green. \nTo the rear of the property the spacious living room is centred around a feature fireplace. This bright room is further enhanced by solid timber flooring while glazed sliding doors lead to a south facing garden patio. \nUpstairs on the first floor there are two spacious double bedrooms (main en-suite), both of which extend the full width of the property. The bedrooms are divided centrally by a beautifully upgraded family bathroom. Finally completing the accommodation is the third and final double bedroom, which is located on the top floor. \nOutside, directly to the front of the property there is ample parking - Pedestrian side access leads through to the rear garden.\n The South facing garden provides the perfect suntrap and ideal for al fresco dining, in the summer months. The garden is mainly lawned and is privately enclosed by a combination of block-built walls and timber fencing. A chalet style garden room offers a significant addition and will lend itself perfectly as a home office, gym or simply secure additional storage, it sits next to a Barna shed - so outdoor storage will never be an issue. \nNumber 12 is enviably located within St. Mary's parish and is walking distance to the wealth of amenities that Lucan Village has to offer.\nLiffey Valley SC is also a short drive, as is access to the M4 and M50 motorways. \nEarly viewing is strongly advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.30m x 4.60m\nA spacious and welcoming entrance hall, which offers - under stair storage, tile flooring, ceiling coving, centre rose, radiator covers, alarm panel, under stair storage and cloak room.\n\nKitchen - 2.2m x 5.42m\nLocated to the front of the property, this kitchen offers a wealth of wall and floor storage space, tile flooring, dual stainless steel sink with mixer tap, four ring hob, oven, washing machine, dishwasher, integrated fridge freezer, tile splash back. A bay window overlooks the green area to the front, and floods the room with natural light.\n\nLiving Room - 5.45m x 4.19m\nThis well-appointed room extends the full width of the property, it offers, solid timber flooring, feature fire with timber mantle, ceiling coving, centre rose, TV point, built in storage units, compact office unit, glazed sliding doors to the south facing rear garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.23m x 3.64m\nDouble bedroom to the rear of the property with laminate flooring, built in wardrobes, modern down lighting, TV Point, overlooking rear garden, access to En-Suite.\n\nEn-Suite - \nSpacious en-suite with tile flooring, standalone shower unit, WC, WHB with fitted overhead mirror with integrated lighting, new mirrored storage unit. down lights. extractor fan, wall towel unit.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.70m x 4.23m\nDouble bedroom to the front of the property, with laminate flooring, built in mirrored wardrobes, overlooking green area.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.23m x 3.24m\nLocated on the third floor this large double room offers, semi solid timber flooring, built in wardrobes, X2 Velux windows. TV point, down lights. WHB, Extra storage units fitted, entrance to floored attic storage space.\n\nBathroom - \nRefurbished -this bathroom provides an extra-large, standalone shower unit with electric shower, recessed shelving, WC, WHB with fitted overhead mirror, extractor fan,underfloor heating and heated towel rail. Down lights\n\nGarden Room - \nDouble insulation, heating, down lighting, alarmed and electric points.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Turn Key Condition. </li><li>3 Bed End Terrace. </li><li>G.F.C.H</li><li> Parking. </li><li>South Facing Rear Garden. </li><li>Garden Room</li><li>Upgraded Main Bathroom (2020) </li><li>St. Mary's Parish </li><li>Close to All Essential Amenities.</li><li>Outdoor sensor lights.</li><li>Close to bus routes, schools, N4 West, Lucan village and Lucan Demesne/ St Catherine's Park, Liffey Valley Shopping Centre</li><li>Alarmed. </li><li>Plumbing/heating updated 2026</ul>"
      },
